    "detailed_description": "This game is about discovering anomalies.<br><br>You are trading stocks at home, but one day odd things start happening, such as someone's foot steps appear in the bathroom or snowing outside in the summer. You need to choose the right button depending on whether there is an anomaly or not. If your decision is right, you can go up to 8th trading day and end the game or go back to normal days.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054180/extras/bfc97be9ca96b42aafd78847e6daa2b2.avif?t=1720643646\" width=640 height=350 /></span><br><br><strong>1.</strong> If you found an anomaly, drink a cold water and then sit on the chair<br><strong>2.</strong> if you found none and everything is normal, just sit one the chair to continue trading stocks<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054180/extras/5eb3f10bf7da67079a552a017de8ed6a.avif?t=1720643646\" width=640 height=358 /></span><br><br>If your decision is right, the trading day on the board will increase.<br>If your decision is not right, you will go back to trading day 1.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2><br>There are 38 anomalies which will spawn randomly and only once. Once one of the anomalies spawns, it will not spawn again.<br>It is possible that you can't see all of the anomalies in the game before you end the game. So, if you want to see all of them, you need to restart the game.<br><br>Playtime will vary but expect around 30minutes.<br><br>Also, there are few minor surprises but none of scary or horror.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay videos and Streaming</h2><br>Feel free to publish any of those.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommanded settings</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054180/extras/edebc9a4f18b0d158869c3fee34c905a.avif?t=1720643646\" width=640 height=358 /></span><br><br>press Z in the game to adjust mouse speed<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054180/extras/438a7710511a321245ca2c406b04a3d3.avif?t=1720643646\" width=640 height=408 /></span><br><br>Also, for who experience screen tearing (graphic broken in a small area), you can turn on Vsync in the setting of mainmenu. But remind that turnning on Vsync can decrease the performance of the game.<br><br>For graphic quaility, High or above is desirable.",
